#: 25b88cdb337c44539a843c674ba6825b PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:1 of
msgid ""
"TCP transport for PyFlow: the server and client base classes and the wire"
" parsers."
msgstr "PyFlowのTCPトランスポート：サーバーとクライアントのベースクラス、および配線パーサー。"

#: 1f1482fc5c2849a68f34c74a8b55ab79 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:3 of
msgid ""
"``TCP_Server_Base`` accepts connections and dispatches inbound lines; "
"``TCP_Client_Base`` connects, sends and reads on the same conventions:"
msgstr ""
"'' TCP_Server_Base ''は、接続を受け入れ、インバウンドラインをディスパッチします。'' TCP_Client_Base "
"''は、同じ規則で接続、送信、読み取りを行います。"

#: 104e5170c1c34bf9ad719f896e0c4226 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:6 of
msgid ""
"one message per line, terminated by a newline; every inbound line is "
"reported to the registered message listeners (commands included), and a "
"line that starts with ``/`` is then dispatched to the command handlers, "
"anything else treated as a plain message;"
msgstr ""

#: 6c6c01958e5741e080edcb804b4d12d1 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:10 of
msgid ""
"unless ``is_enable_encrypto`` is False, an encrypted channel is "
"negotiated right after connect: the handshake lines and the public-key "
"pushes stay plaintext, then every later message travels as a frame (RSA-"
"OAEP for small text payloads, an ECDH-keyed AES-GCM seal for everything "
"else, including file data), and each file/folder transfer sub-connection "
"is framed the same way once both sides hold the session keys (see "
"`_SecureChannel`);"
msgstr ""

#: 9702905f1f8a4750905b2ffb96f99ec8 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:16 of
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"file/folder transfer, message forwarding and port allocation are layered "
"on the same socket and share its command namespace;"
msgstr "ファイル/フォルダ転送、メッセージ転送、およびポート割り当ては、同じソケット上に重ねられ、そのコマンド名前空間を共有します。"

#: 3488995e2a8349a58393d9f2d1155b99 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:18 of
msgid ""
"an interrupted transfer is resumed after a disconnect: both sides persist"
" their transfer stores under the protocol's ``.Flow`` directory and the "
"receiver asks the sender to continue the file from the bytes already on "
"disk (``resume_transfers``; the wire lines are ``/resume_trans`` and "
"``/forward_resume``)."
msgstr ""

#: 4cc5743bdfe54148ad38f54f10e688c9 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:24 of
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The forwarding extensions use the module-level parsers "
"`parse_forwarded_message`, `parse_forward_items_and_addrs`, "
"`parse_forward_originator` and `forward_skip_message`; the reconnect "
"logic uses `parse_resume_command`, `parse_forward_resume_command` and "
"`_resume_offset_for`."
msgstr ""
"転送拡張機能は、モジュールレベルのパーサー`parse_forwarded_message '、` "
"parse_forward_items_and_addrs '、`parse_forward_originator '、および` "
"forward_skip_message `を使用します。"

#: 49796529cb7f49ee8131b257212b5420 PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp:30 of
msgid ""
"Concepts live in ``docs/source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst`` and "
"``TCP_Client_APIs.rst``; argument, return and exception contracts live in"
" the docstrings below."
msgstr ""
"コンセプトは'' docs/source/NETWORK_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst ''および'' "
"TCP_Client_APIs.rst ''にあります。引数、戻り値、例外の契約は以下のdocstringにあります。"

